{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"设计系统基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-system-fundamentals","title":"设计系统的本质与价值模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/foundations/design-system-fundamentals","wordCount":1202,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture-layers","title":"设计系统架构分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/foundations/architecture-layers","wordCount":1012,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"headless-primitives","title":"Headless 组件原语选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/foundations/headless-primitives","wordCount":1124,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"设计系统基础\">设计系统基础</h1><p>本章建立设计系统的概念框架与决策模型。从&quot;什么是设计系统&quot;的本质出发，经过架构分层的核心模型，最终抵达 headless 组件原语的技术选型——这三篇构成后续所有实践章节的理论基石。</p>\n<p>学完本章后，你将能够清晰地向团队解释设计系统的投资回报逻辑，画出完整的技术架构分层图，并在 Radix UI、Ark UI 等主流方案间做出有据可依的选型决策。</p>\n"}